---
<section class="skills-section section-shell" id="skills" aria-labelledby="skills-title"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Coaching expertise</span><span class="section-note">The support behind your progress</span></div><div class="skills-grid"><div class="skills-intro reveal"><h2 id="skills-title">More than<br /><em>a workout.</em></h2><p>Training, nutrition, and personal feedback. Connected through a coach who understands the work.</p><a class="text-link" href="#pricing">Find your coaching pack <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="skills-list">{skills.map(([number, title, description]) => <article class="skill-row reveal"><span>{number}</span><div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{description}</p></div><span class="skill-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></article>)}</div></div></section>
